## Use the reference in your own content

Keep `unknown`, `unavailable` and a real zero apart. Use the source label, then add what the task needs. A lock can report Locked without anyone checking the door. A thermostat can be set to Heat while it is idle. A helper can store On without switching a device.

For an integration you do not know, read its documentation. Keep the value as supplied until you know what it means. Do not translate it, borrow another device’s meaning or hide it behind “success”.

See the [terminology register](../reference/ha-terminology.json) for every source. Use [entity state](../home-assistant/entity-state.html) for freshness and missing data, and [action results](../home-assistant/action-results.html) for requests and confirmation.
